cad` | 422 系エラー(build/tessellate 失敗を JSON で返す) |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:5886:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2431:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1912:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review.md:276:crates/mycad-kernel/src/primitives/cylinder.rs:180:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:5887:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2434:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1917:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review.md:1115:    /// T06: Normal tessellation — triangle count for cylinder with default 32 angular segments.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:5888:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2435:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1918:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review.md:1134:    /// T07: Determinism — same input → same output.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:5889:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2436:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1919:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review.md:1151:    /// T08: Regression — cuboid tessellation is byte-identical to pre-cylinder output.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:5890:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2437:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1920:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review.md:1164:    /// T08 extended: exact positions and indices snapshot.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:5891:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2438:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1921:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review.md:1181:    /// T09: Outward normals — all facet normals point away from centroid.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:5892:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2439:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1923:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review.md:1718:    ///